#. module: bf_attachment_version
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_attachment_version.action_bf_attachment_version
msgid ""
"A version appears here as soon as an attachment has its content replaced, by"
" an office editor or otherwise. It holds the bytes from before the "
"replacement."
